### 52. The mixed-units sample — hours, days and weeks in one network, on a
# 1-hour period. Expect 201 with 0 errors and 4 warnings: one
# DURATION_ROUNDING_ERROR (a 90-minute processing time is 1.5 periods) and three
# LATERAL_LINK (DC-to-DC arcs). Unit tokens here are abbreviated and mixed-case
# on purpose — h, hr, hrs, d, wk, Weeks, min, HOUR.
POST {{baseUrl}}/networks/import
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=SNRM

--SNRM
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="projectId"

{{projectId}}
--SNRM
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Mixed units
--SNRM
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="network_meta.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

